      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHERE'S TIMMY (2) flew the lids with a fast early split last time, hitting the frame with a 0.8 lengths second (17.28) over 300m at this track and making it two placings on end. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Ready to find winning form. BURNT TANGERINE (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.17 beating Divergence. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. FLAMINGO GIRL (5) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 5th (17.48) at Murray Bridge. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Worth another chance. SHELLY'S GIRL (8) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance - should be thereabouts.",
